sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Explorer
    participant UI as Planet / Mission / Rover Card
    participant VaultStore as Zustand Store (useVaultStore)
    participant Engine as Achievement Definitions (computeAchievements)
    participant Storage as VaultStorageService (localStorage)

    User->>UI: Click Bookmark Star ("Save")
    UI->>VaultStore: toggleFavorite(favoriteItemPayload)
    activate VaultStore
    VaultStore->>VaultStore: Append FavoriteItem to favorites[]
    VaultStore->>VaultStore: logExplorationEvent('planet_viewed', entityId)
    VaultStore->>Engine: computeAchievements(currentContext)
    activate Engine
    Engine->>Engine: Evaluate 12 Achievement Evaluators
    Engine->>Engine: Derive Clearance Level & Rank
    Engine-->>VaultStore: Return Updated Achievements[] & Rank
    deactivate Engine
    VaultStore->>Storage: saveState(versionedEnvelope)
    Storage->>Storage: Serialize to JSON ('cosmostellaratlas:user:v1')
    Storage-->>VaultStore: Persistence Confirmation
    VaultStore-->>UI: Reactive State Emitted
    deactivate VaultStore
    UI-->>User: Button State Changes to "Saved" (Glowing Gold Star)

